1
00:01:43,490 --> 00:01:47,660
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,940
[Episode 19]

3
00:01:51,509 --> 00:01:52,590
Where is my brother?

4
00:01:52,590 --> 00:01:53,920
Did you go look for him later?

5
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:54,280
I...

6
00:01:55,710 --> 00:01:57,680
I forgot. I don't remember.

7
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,640
I... I called him as soon as I woke up,

8
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,950
but I couldn't get through.

9
00:02:00,950 --> 00:02:01,870
I looked everywhere.

10
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,350
I... I couldn't find him.

11
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:04,480
Oh no.

12
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,010
He's been missing for a day.

13
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,120
This is bad.

14
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,430
Ke!

15
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,310
Zhou Ke!

16
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:13,240
How did Mr. Zhou go missing?

17
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:14,710
Mr. Zhou!

18
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:16,280
Mr. Zhou is missing!

19
00:02:59,630 --> 00:03:01,090
What kind of wine was that?

20
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,220
I really shouldn't have drunk it.

21
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,630
Sister?

22
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:36,590
Ximei!

23
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:38,470
Zhen!

24
00:03:39,070 --> 00:03:39,930
Is anyone here?

25
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,430
Jiahao!

26
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,710
Zhen!

27
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,960
Is anyone here? Where am I?

28
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,590
Help!

29
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,030
Help!

30
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:11,400
Is anyone here?

31
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,269
Is anyone here?

32
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,290
Zhen, you...

33
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:36,560
Zhou Ke! Zhou Ke!

34
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,320
I made hangover soup for you.

35
00:04:40,430 --> 00:04:42,030
Bingqiang, why are you here?

36
00:04:42,150 --> 00:04:43,210
Did you see Zhou Ke?

37
00:04:44,430 --> 00:04:45,360
I didn't see him,

38
00:04:45,830 --> 00:04:47,690
just as you didn't see me just now.

39
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:49,000
Zhou Ke is gone.

40
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:50,310
Is he missing?

41
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,760
I heard you blacked out yesterday?

42
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,220
You don't remember anything?

43
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,510
Is it possible

44
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,040
that Zhou Ke isn't missing at all

45
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:05,520
and just doesn't want to see you?

46
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,120
What do you mean?

47
00:05:16,630 --> 00:05:17,630
Look what this is.

48
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:26,360
Why do you have this knife?

49
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,360
I was the only sober one yesterday.

50
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:32,560
Let me help you remember what happened.

51
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
After dinner last night,

52
00:05:35,510 --> 00:05:37,800
I suddenly missed the sea in Barcelona,

53
00:05:38,390 --> 00:05:40,360
so I went for a walk on the beach.

54
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,360
I accidentally bumped into you and Zhou Ke

55
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,530
and overheard your conversation.

56
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:49,120
You heard everything?

57
00:05:51,070 --> 00:05:52,430
So what did we say?

58
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,730
You confessed your love to Zhou Ke.

59
00:05:57,830 --> 00:06:00,070
Then what did Zhou Ke say?

60
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,270
What he said—

61
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,570
you'd better not know.

62
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:07,240
Tell me.

63
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:09,750
Tell me.

64
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,920
You really shouldn't know.

65
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,380
Tell me!

66
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:14,950
Forget it.

67
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,400
I'm not the one
who broke your heart anyway.

68
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:22,720
You took out this small knife

69
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,250
and wanted to give it to him.

70
00:06:24,390 --> 00:06:25,390
You told him

71
00:06:25,410 --> 00:06:28,010
this knife was for the person
you love the most.

72
00:06:28,430 --> 00:06:29,310
He took it.

73
00:06:30,390 --> 00:06:31,920
I thought he accepted your love.

74
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,360
I was so happy for you two.

75
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,150
But...

76
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:37,950
he threw the knife on the beach!

77
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,000
Was it the knife he threw?

78
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,480
He threw your heart away!

79
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:45,560
I really wanted to go

80
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:48,000
and punch that Zhou Ke.

81
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,070
But I was raised

82
00:06:50,070 --> 00:06:51,240
better than that!

83
00:06:51,950 --> 00:06:54,210
I could only watch helplessly as he left,

84
00:06:58,240 --> 00:07:00,300
then quietly pick up the little knife

85
00:07:00,510 --> 00:07:01,750
and the pieces

86
00:07:01,750 --> 00:07:02,950
of your broken heart.

87
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,480
So I...

88
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,950
Zhen! Zhen!

89
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,240
I'll watch the house for you.

90
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,510
If Zhou Ke dares to come back,

91
00:07:13,510 --> 00:07:15,240
I'll let you know immediately!

92
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,430
Why?

93
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:28,270
Because... I like you too!

94
00:07:30,390 --> 00:07:31,360
Really?

95
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,680
Say it again!

96
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:34,830
I like you!

97
00:07:35,270 --> 00:07:35,870
Me too!

98
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:36,950
I like you!

99
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,700
Where is my lipstick?

100
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,190
Zhen.

101
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:50,630
Zhen.

102
00:07:51,240 --> 00:07:52,430
I have something to tell you, Zhen.

103
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,600
Wait, wait. Bingqiang. Bingqiang.

104
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,190
Here's the thing...

105
00:07:54,190 --> 00:07:55,390
I... I need to talk to you
about something urgent.

106
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:56,630
Wait, wait. I came to find Zhen first.

107
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:58,150
Bingqiang, come on. Come with me.

108
00:07:58,150 --> 00:07:59,350
Let me talk to Zhen...

109
00:08:58,440 --> 00:09:00,150
Granny, have you seen Zhou Ke?

110
00:09:00,150 --> 00:09:00,910
No.

111
00:09:00,910 --> 00:09:01,600
No?

112
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,530
Have you seen Zhou Ke, Mr. Zhou?

113
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:04,170
No.

114
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,240
I haven't seen Mr. Zhou.

115
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,440
You haven't seen him?

116
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,240
Zhen, did you find him?

117
00:09:11,870 --> 00:09:12,910
No, I didn't.

118
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,630
What should we do?

119
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,720
Let's call the police.

120
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,790
Don't call the police.

121
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:18,750
Could it be that

122
00:09:19,150 --> 00:09:21,510
he just left?

123
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:23,240
Left?

124
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,720
No way. I'm still here.

125
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,790
Where could he go?

126
00:09:27,120 --> 00:09:28,840
Has he ever done this before,

127
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:32,790
leaving suddenly without saying goodbye?

128
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:35,010
Actually, yes.

129
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,360
Not much. About 20 times.

130
00:09:38,790 --> 00:09:40,600
He has an avoidant attachment style.

131
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,440
Whenever he runs into a problem
he can't solve,

132
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,440
he runs away from it.

133
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:45,390
The worst case

134
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,600
was when a girl he didn't like

135
00:09:46,600 --> 00:09:47,750
confessed her feelings for him.

136
00:09:47,750 --> 00:09:48,440
He was so flustered

137
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:50,000
and didn't know how to respond

138
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,840
that he disappeared for over a week.

139
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,440
I called the police then too.

140
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:55,120
The police couldn't find him.

141
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,120
Later, we found out

142
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:58,180
he was hiding in the wardrobe at home.

143
00:09:59,790 --> 00:10:02,030
He couldn't be hiding
in the wardrobe this time, could he?

144
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:04,360
This brat. Does he think he's in Parasite?

145
00:10:29,930 --> 00:10:30,590
Who are you?

146
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,550
-You're here.
-I was just passing by.

147
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:33,200
Bro, don't! I was just passing by.

148
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:33,720
Let's talk this out!

149
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:34,720
D-Don't stab me, okay?

150
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,320
Let's talk this out!

151
00:10:35,320 --> 00:10:36,510
Why are you yelling?

152
00:10:36,870 --> 00:10:37,870
How did you get in?

153
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:39,040
Did you buy a ticket?

154
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,670
Mr. Song?

155
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:43,000
Mr. Song?

156
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:48,660
What are you doing?

157
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,750
Mr. Song, you scared me to death.

158
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:52,480
I thought I went to the wilder—

159
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,080
Get away.
Don't act like we know each other!

160
00:10:54,080 --> 00:10:55,240
I asked if you bought a ticket.

161
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,240
Who are you?

162
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:58,120
I-I'm from Shapu Village.

163
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,150
The planner.

164
00:10:59,150 --> 00:10:59,910
The fishball restaurant.

165
00:10:59,910 --> 00:11:00,270
See?

166
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,690
Did you buy a ticket?

167
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,120
What ticket?

168
00:11:04,630 --> 00:11:05,660
What is this place?

169
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:07,570
This is the biggest live-action show

170
00:11:07,570 --> 00:11:09,330
in our Songyan Island Film Town:

171
00:11:09,330 --> 00:11:11,180
Stabbing the Outsider to Death,

172
00:11:11,210 --> 00:11:12,740
an immersive performance.

173
00:11:13,750 --> 00:11:15,390
And you just barged right into
our performance area.

174
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:16,790
Will the audience be watching you

175
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:18,000
or our actors performing?

176
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,240
Exactly. How did you get in?

177
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,750
Come on. You ruined everything.

178
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,510
I'm sorry.

179
00:11:21,510 --> 00:11:22,970
I don't know how I got here.

180
00:11:23,270 --> 00:11:24,550
Well... Mr. Song.

181
00:11:24,790 --> 00:11:27,200
How can I get back
to Shapu Village from here?

182
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,350
You pay to take a boat back.

183
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,320
I don't have money.

184
00:11:33,090 --> 00:11:35,220
Then build a boat yourself and go back.

185
00:11:36,550 --> 00:11:38,200
Mr. Song,
lend me some money so I can go back.

186
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,670
Why should I lend you money?

187
00:11:39,670 --> 00:11:42,330
I'm from Shapu Village.
We've worked together.

188
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:44,390
What commission?

189
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,990
I'm a legitimate tour guide!

190
00:11:46,030 --> 00:11:47,080
Let's go. Time to work.

191
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,150
Let's go. Let's go.

192
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,670
-Take more photos with them.
-I just need a little money.

193
00:11:49,670 --> 00:11:51,270
-Thanks, guys.
-I just need to take a boat back.

194
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:53,330
How much commission will you give me?

195
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:55,320
If you lend me the money to get back,

196
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:57,150
For Shapu Village No. 1 Guesthouse,

197
00:11:57,150 --> 00:11:58,080
I'll give you...

198
00:11:58,550 --> 00:11:59,390
That much?

199
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:00,810
Is that okay?

200
00:12:00,910 --> 00:12:02,030
Is that up to you?

201
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:04,120
Yeah. My future girlfriend runs it.

202
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,450
Don't worry.

203
00:12:05,600 --> 00:12:07,730
I definitely won't lend you any money.

204
00:12:07,750 --> 00:12:09,270
But I'll arrange for you to go back.

205
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:10,320
That works. That works.

206
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:12,600
On one condition—you must tell me

207
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:14,270
how you got here.

208
00:12:59,870 --> 00:13:00,910
Thank you, sir.

209
00:13:01,150 --> 00:13:02,910
Thank you, sir. Thank you.

210
00:13:16,150 --> 00:13:17,240
I'm finally back.

211
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:22,000
Zhen.

212
00:13:25,150 --> 00:13:25,710
Zhen!

213
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:27,030
Zhen!

214
00:13:27,910 --> 00:13:28,480
Zhen!

215
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:29,080
Zhou Ke.

216
00:13:34,390 --> 00:13:35,190
Where is Zhen?

217
00:13:35,750 --> 00:13:36,680
I didn't see her.

218
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,050
Why are you here?

219
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,150
I've been looking for you all day.

220
00:13:39,150 --> 00:13:40,480
I even made soup for you.

221
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:41,820
Come on.

222
00:13:42,910 --> 00:13:43,370
Come on.

223
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:45,600
Sorry.

224
00:13:46,390 --> 00:13:48,250
Being a neat freak is my bad habit.

225
00:13:51,790 --> 00:13:52,750
Slow down.

226
00:13:53,900 --> 00:13:54,550
What happened?

227
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:56,080
How did you end up like this?

228
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:01,390
That alcohol yesterday was too strong.

229
00:14:01,390 --> 00:14:02,360
I blacked out.

230
00:14:03,630 --> 00:14:04,870
I don't know how

231
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,090
I ended up on a deserted island.

232
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,080
I almost didn't make it back.

233
00:14:09,550 --> 00:14:10,320
Thank you.

234
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,480
You... you blacked out?

235
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:15,380
You don't remember anything?

236
00:14:16,030 --> 00:14:16,910
Not really.

237
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:20,070
Where is Zhen?

238
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,790
Zhen...

239
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:28,010
She doesn't want to see you.

240
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:33,480
Why?

241
00:14:33,750 --> 00:14:36,510
Did I do something yesterday?

242
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:38,870
I'm the one who remembers yesterday
the most clearly.

243
00:14:38,870 --> 00:14:40,910
Let me help you remember what happened.

244
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:43,120
After dinner yesterday,

245
00:14:43,120 --> 00:14:44,980
I really missed the sea in Naples,

246
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:47,030
so I went for a walk on the beach.

247
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:49,030
I accidentally ran into you and Zhen

248
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:51,480
and overheard your conversation.

249
00:14:55,390 --> 00:14:57,750
You... heard everything?

250
00:15:03,670 --> 00:15:04,790
What did you hear?

251
00:15:06,670 --> 00:15:08,470
You confessed your love to Zhen.

252
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:15,720
And then?

253
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:18,030
What... What did she say?

254
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:22,860
You'd better not know.

255
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,930
It's okay. Just tell me.

256
00:15:27,150 --> 00:15:28,320
Just tell me.

257
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,180
I'd rather not.

258
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:30,550
Tell me!

259
00:15:31,630 --> 00:15:32,430
Sorry. Sorry.

260
00:15:33,870 --> 00:15:34,840
Tell me.

261
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,720
Tell me. I want to hear it.

262
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,000
Forget it.

263
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:42,430
I'm not the one
who broke your heart anyway.

264
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:47,640
Zhen explicitly rejected you.

265
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,670
She said she doesn't like you at all,

266
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:54,800
and that you made her feel very awkward
by doing that.

267
00:15:56,960 --> 00:15:58,390
When I saw how heartbroken you were,

268
00:15:58,390 --> 00:16:00,590
I wanted to rush up
and give you a big hug.

269
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:01,900
But then I thought,

270
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,600
this... this might be the highlight

271
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,910
of your life.

272
00:16:04,910 --> 00:16:05,320
So I...

273
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:08,910
Zhou Ke,

274
00:16:10,790 --> 00:16:12,510
I must thank you.

275
00:16:13,390 --> 00:16:14,630
If you hadn't

276
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,650
pushed Zhen yesterday,

277
00:16:17,510 --> 00:16:18,670
she wouldn't have

278
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,610
made up her mind so quickly.

279
00:16:27,870 --> 00:16:30,600
This knife
can only be given to someone I like.

280
00:16:34,350 --> 00:16:35,180
So...

281
00:16:39,550 --> 00:16:40,440
You guys...

282
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,550
Zhou Ke, I... I really want to thank you.

283
00:16:43,550 --> 00:16:46,270
No, we both really want to thank you.

284
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:48,030
Your work in Shapu Village

285
00:16:48,030 --> 00:16:49,200
is basically done.

286
00:16:49,790 --> 00:16:51,670
But if you'd like to stay,

287
00:16:52,430 --> 00:16:54,100
our door is always open to you.

288
