00:28:38,270 --> 00:28:38,590
I can tell.

572
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:39,720
I work really fast.

573
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,270
Yeah.

574
00:28:40,270 --> 00:28:41,750
Mr. Shark! Wait a moment!

575
00:28:41,950 --> 00:28:42,800
Let me help you!

576
00:28:42,800 --> 00:28:44,000
No, no. No need!

577
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,000
Zhen!

578
00:28:47,590 --> 00:28:48,200
Zhen!

579
00:28:48,200 --> 00:28:48,960
No, no. Zhen!

580
00:28:48,960 --> 00:28:49,590
Zhen!

581
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:50,960
Let me help you!

582
00:28:51,160 --> 00:28:52,590
Zhen, do you know how to fix a faucet?

583
00:28:52,590 --> 00:28:53,480
Let me do it.

584
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,240
Don't worry.

585
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:54,840
I know how.

586
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:02,940
Why is my computer broken?

587
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:03,840
Leave it to me!

588
00:29:05,920 --> 00:29:07,640
Zhen, your hands are all wet!

589
00:29:10,350 --> 00:29:10,880
This kid.

590
00:29:12,510 --> 00:29:13,640
I have a dream.

591
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:16,510
I hope the township bank

592
00:29:17,110 --> 00:29:20,510
will be filled with our villagers' money.

593
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,920
I hope Chuanao and Shapu

594
00:29:24,070 --> 00:29:27,720
can break the centuries-old tradition
of not intermarrying!

595
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,720
I have a dream...

596
00:29:29,720 --> 00:29:31,240
Brother,
are you preparing for your speech?

597
00:29:31,240 --> 00:29:32,030
How is it?

598
00:29:32,370 --> 00:29:33,470
I'll write it for you.

599
00:29:33,470 --> 00:29:35,240
Wait. I've already finished writing it.

600
00:29:35,240 --> 00:29:36,240
Then I'll copy it for you.

601
00:29:36,240 --> 00:29:38,180
No need. I'll just read from it
when the time comes.

602
00:29:38,180 --> 00:29:39,270
Then I'll read it for you.

603
00:29:39,270 --> 00:29:40,640
I'd better read it myself.

604
00:29:40,640 --> 00:29:41,750
Then I'll help you correct it.

605
00:29:41,750 --> 00:29:42,750
I'll help you fix the punctuation.

606
00:29:42,750 --> 00:29:44,200
You're a bit weird today.

607
00:29:45,590 --> 00:29:47,850
What's that smell? What are you cooking?

608
00:30:00,310 --> 00:30:01,640
Were you cooking a bomb?

609
00:30:03,480 --> 00:30:05,340
Let me do it. It can still be saved!

610
00:30:07,080 --> 00:30:07,960
It can still be saved!

611
00:30:07,960 --> 00:30:08,750
Let me do it.

612
00:30:19,280 --> 00:30:21,680
So, my take is that

613
00:30:21,750 --> 00:30:23,000
since our Ke left,

614
00:30:23,000 --> 00:30:24,200
Zhen couldn't adapt,

615
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:27,570
so she wanted to find something
to keep herself busy.

616
00:30:28,310 --> 00:30:29,240
It's been so many years.

617
00:30:29,240 --> 00:30:30,370
I've never seen Zhen

618
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:32,440
so absent-minded.

619
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:38,640
Just guessing.

620
00:30:38,640 --> 00:30:39,070
Okay.

621
00:30:39,070 --> 00:30:39,830
I know.

622
00:30:40,310 --> 00:30:41,590
She has PT...

623
00:30:42,120 --> 00:30:43,340
ENFP.

624
00:30:44,790 --> 00:30:46,390
Nonsense. That's called...

625
00:30:46,590 --> 00:30:48,680
OOTD, right?

626
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:49,160
O...

627
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:50,680
That's called PESTD!

628
00:30:50,830 --> 00:30:51,680
You guys mean

629
00:30:51,680 --> 00:30:52,990
PTSD, right?

630
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:56,040
Didn't we say the same thing?

631
00:30:57,210 --> 00:30:58,590
It suddenly occurred to me.

632
00:30:58,590 --> 00:30:59,790
Mr. Zhou has been gone for so long.

633
00:30:59,790 --> 00:31:01,850
Why hasn't he contacted me even once?

634
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:02,680
Not just you.

635
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:04,070
He hasn't contacted me either.

636
00:31:04,070 --> 00:31:05,030
He contacted none of us?

637
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:06,090
It doesn't matter.

638
00:31:06,510 --> 00:31:08,830
As long as Zhen is in good shape,
that's the most important thing.

639
00:31:08,830 --> 00:31:10,510
Zhen's Big Fish Balls!

640
00:31:11,270 --> 00:31:12,680
Delicious and fun!

641
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,830
Fish balls.

642
00:31:13,830 --> 00:31:15,240
Delicious and chewy.

643
00:31:15,240 --> 00:31:17,680
Chewy, chewy... Zhen's Fish Balls

644
00:31:18,350 --> 00:31:19,270
relieve coughs and reduce phlegm!

645
00:31:19,270 --> 00:31:20,310
It's so lit!

646
00:31:22,070 --> 00:31:23,200
"Eww" definitely doesn't rhyme.

647
00:31:23,200 --> 00:31:24,680
How could "eww" rhyme?

648
00:31:24,680 --> 00:31:26,140
You have something to say?

649
00:31:28,270 --> 00:31:30,590
You can't have a problem
with our boy band.

650
00:31:30,590 --> 00:31:31,390
What's wrong?

651
00:31:31,720 --> 00:31:32,720
Is this for the show?

652
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,520
He's choking?

653
00:31:33,650 --> 00:31:34,760
Director!

654
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:35,720
He's choking!

655
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:36,250
Water...

656
00:31:36,680 --> 00:31:37,350
Hurry!

657
00:31:38,880 --> 00:31:39,680
He's choking!

658
00:31:41,590 --> 00:31:43,920
You can't drink this! This water is not...

659
00:31:44,200 --> 00:31:45,310
Where is it?

660
00:31:45,310 --> 00:31:46,310
Here!

661
00:31:49,550 --> 00:31:51,010
I'll squeeze it out of him!

662
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:54,730
Sister, how is that person?

663
00:31:55,110 --> 00:31:57,170
Fortunately, he was rescued in time.

664
00:31:57,240 --> 00:31:59,370
Otherwise, I wouldn't know what to do.

665
00:32:04,400 --> 00:32:05,330
It's her, right?

666
00:32:08,100 --> 00:32:09,620
That girl named Zhen.

667
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:11,530
You came back to the village

668
00:32:11,750 --> 00:32:13,280
because of her, didn't you?

669
00:32:14,270 --> 00:32:15,310
And you lied to me,

670
00:32:15,880 --> 00:32:18,280
saying it was to help develop
your village.

671
00:32:19,310 --> 00:32:20,160
As expected,

672
00:32:20,590 --> 00:32:21,440
nothing can be hidden

673
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,960
from your beautiful eyes.

674
00:32:24,110 --> 00:32:25,590
I've known you for so long.

675
00:32:26,270 --> 00:32:28,440
One scan with my beautiful eyes,

676
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:30,510
and I can see right through you.

677
00:32:30,510 --> 00:32:30,960
Yes.

678
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:33,240
You've helped me for so many years,

679
00:32:33,240 --> 00:32:35,240
and I've always wanted to repay you.

680
00:32:35,640 --> 00:32:35,960
I...

681
00:32:36,590 --> 00:32:39,240
I wish I could pluck the stars
and give them to you.

682
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:40,500
But looking at you now,

683
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:42,710
the stars are already in your eyes.

684
00:32:42,750 --> 00:32:43,400
Really?

685
00:32:44,240 --> 00:32:46,590
Well, we're close to the stars tonight,

686
00:32:47,030 --> 00:32:48,070
so go ahead and pluck them.

687
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,000
I'll be waiting.

688
00:32:52,960 --> 00:32:55,310
I... I... I'm plucking.

689
00:32:57,270 --> 00:32:58,480
Oh, come on.

690
00:32:58,680 --> 00:32:59,960
Save your sweet talk

691
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:01,310
for your Zhen.

692
00:33:02,310 --> 00:33:05,350
Sister, I'm telling you the truth.

693
00:33:05,640 --> 00:33:08,270
It only sounds sweet because I'm with you.

694
00:33:10,550 --> 00:33:11,480
I believe you.

695
00:33:12,830 --> 00:33:14,030
You don't really plan

696
00:33:14,750 --> 00:33:17,030
to stay in this little fishing village
forever, do you?

697
00:33:17,030 --> 00:33:17,480
No.

698
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:20,960
I hate this village.

699
00:33:24,110 --> 00:33:25,310
When I was little,

700
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,500
the villagers here

701
00:33:29,260 --> 00:33:31,350
reported my dad for scamming them.

702
00:33:34,750 --> 00:33:35,610
The people here

703
00:33:36,070 --> 00:33:37,880
gave me a miserable childhood.

704
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:40,750
Then why

705
00:33:40,750 --> 00:33:43,010
are you still helping this village grow?

706
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:45,030
I'm just too kind-hearted.

707
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:49,580
I came back to repay the kindness
I received through those fish balls.

708
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,000
Don't cry.

709
00:33:54,640 --> 00:33:56,300
When I was at my most helpless,

710
00:33:58,110 --> 00:33:59,070
Zhen was the one

711
00:33:59,790 --> 00:34:01,850
who gave me warmth like a ray of light.

712
00:34:09,030 --> 00:34:11,159
What if she doesn't want to be with you?

713
00:34:12,350 --> 00:34:15,270
That's why I'm here to ask for your help.

714
00:34:16,510 --> 00:34:17,770
Are you that confident

715
00:34:18,670 --> 00:34:20,270
that I can help you woo a girl?

716
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:22,150
If you don't want to help me,

717
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,460
I completely understand.

718
00:34:25,230 --> 00:34:27,510
But in this world,

719
00:34:28,150 --> 00:34:30,760
you're the only person I can rely on.

720
00:34:33,030 --> 00:34:33,670
Then,

721
00:34:34,030 --> 00:34:35,920
what's in it for me if I help you?

722
00:34:39,030 --> 00:34:40,150
Sister...

723
00:34:44,480 --> 00:34:44,880
I...

724
00:34:45,710 --> 00:34:46,360
I...

725
00:34:46,429 --> 00:34:48,429
Alright. Forget it.

726
00:34:48,480 --> 00:34:49,940
I don't need any benefits.

727
00:34:50,590 --> 00:34:51,480
However,

728
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,590
I just took over this show.

729
00:34:53,590 --> 00:34:55,110
I have to be responsible for the crew.

730
00:34:55,110 --> 00:34:55,880
Most importantly,

731
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,400
I have to be responsible
for these artists.

732
00:34:57,400 --> 00:34:58,070
You know?

733
00:34:59,130 --> 00:35:00,520
Also, I found that the terrain
in this village

734
00:35:00,520 --> 00:35:01,790
is very complicated.

735
00:35:01,960 --> 00:35:03,280
Find me some locals

736
00:35:04,110 --> 00:35:05,070
to work as production assistants.

737
00:35:05,070 --> 00:35:06,200
No problem, Sister.

738
00:35:06,630 --> 00:35:07,960
I'll make an announcement
over the village's loudspeaker right now

739
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:09,290
and call people for you.

740
00:35:09,440 --> 00:35:10,570
Sister, wait for me.

741
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:22,760
Zhen.

742
00:35:23,210 --> 00:35:24,670
Stop wiping for now, will you?

743
00:35:24,670 --> 00:35:25,880
It's about to spark.

744
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:26,680
I'm not tired.

745
00:35:26,960 --> 00:35:28,560
Are you trying to make a fire?

746
00:35:28,760 --> 00:35:29,400
No.

747
00:35:30,400 --> 00:35:31,110
Sister,

748
00:35:31,870 --> 00:35:34,930
you seem a bit abnormal lately.

749
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:35,670
Yeah.

750
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:38,320
I'm fine.

751
00:35:38,550 --> 00:35:40,410
Look, your jacket is upside down.

752
00:35:44,710 --> 00:35:45,510
I was in a hurry

753
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:46,710
to take the artists to the hospital,

754
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:48,630
so I put it on upside down.

755
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:51,630
Also,

756
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:53,690
the fish balls you made before

757
00:35:54,760 --> 00:35:56,760
have never... caused any problems.

758
00:35:57,030 --> 00:35:58,360
That was not my fault.

759
00:35:58,880 --> 00:36:00,430
He ate too fast.

760
00:36:00,510 --> 00:36:01,840
It was my first time too.

761
00:36:03,150 --> 00:36:05,030
Well, how about this?

762
00:36:05,030 --> 00:36:07,070
Zhen, go upstairs and rest.

763
00:36:07,070 --> 00:36:08,480
You'll feel better after some sleep.

764
00:36:08,480 --> 00:36:09,110
Right.

765
00:36:09,110 --> 00:36:09,630
I'm not tired.

766
00:36:09,630 --> 00:36:10,510
I can't rest for a moment.

767
00:36:10,510 --> 00:36:11,630
I want to contribute to the village.

768
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:12,360
I want to work.

769
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,880
You can give me any job.

770
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:14,590
I can do anything!

771
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,190
I want to work!

772
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:16,360
Work, work, work!

773
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:18,160
I can't waste my time.

774
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:19,150
I want to contribute to the village.

775
00:36:19,150 --> 00:36:20,150
Workers wanted! Workers wanted!

776
00:36:20,150 --> 00:36:20,480
What kind of work?

777
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:21,550
Come sign up!

778
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:27,150
What did she eat to be so energetic?

779
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,980
She has the strength of an ox.

780
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:35,710
Alright,
let's move on to the next segment.

781
00:36:35,710 --> 00:36:37,170
Who will get the task card?

782
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,590
Doing this, Team Blue?

783
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,790
We have a slight edge.

784
00:36:45,880 --> 00:36:47,320
Modesty.

785
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:51,360
Team Pink and Team Blue
will each send one person

786
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:54,110
to pose like Yin Tinchiu and Liu Piaopiao
under the tree.

787
00:36:54,110 --> 00:36:55,910
The first to make the other laugh

788
00:36:56,170 --> 00:36:56,940
gets a point.

789
00:36:57,280 --> 00:36:58,070
Understand?

790
00:36:58,070 --> 00:36:58,840
Yes.

791
00:36:58,840 --> 00:36:59,440
Director.

792
00:36:59,810 --> 00:37:00,540
Let's start.

793
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:01,600
Okay, action.

794
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:09,280
Just spray him.

795
00:37:10,190 --> 00:37:11,880
Should we do it like this?

796
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:13,800
What are you doing?

797
00:37:13,800 --> 00:37:15,030
Which one should I ride?

798
00:37:15,030 --> 00:37:15,560
Let's go.

799
00:37:22,800 --> 00:37:23,590
Don't look!

800
00:37:23,590 --> 00:37:24,630
What are you looking at?

801
00:37:24,630 --> 00:37:25,190
Go!

802
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:26,320
Use qi and...

803
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,020
Okay, that's good.

804
00:37:29,150 --> 00:37:30,070
Let's switch camera angles.

805
00:37:30,070 --> 00:37:31,070
-Okay. Thank you, Director.
-Fix the continuity errors.

806
00:37:31,070 --> 00:37:32,070
Thank you, Director.

807
00:37:32,070 --> 00:37:33,030
Fix the continuity errors.

808
00:37:33,030 --> 00:37:33,320
Come on.

809
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,920
Move these things over here.

810
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:49,590
Come on, what's going on, guys?

811
00:37:50,190 --> 00:37:52,070
You've hurt our artist
time and time again,

812
00:37:52,070 --> 00:37:53,840
and it's always the same person.

813
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,970
Girl, are you an anti-fan of Zhiliang?

814
00:37:57,030 --> 00:37:58,230
Are you a "black jelly?"

815
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:59,320
No, it's... No.

816
00:37:59,320 --> 00:38:01,400
She definitely can't
be an anti-fan of Zhiliang.

817
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:02,670
She doesn't even know who Zhiliang is.

818
00:38:02,670 --> 00:38:03,670
How could she be his anti-fan?

819
00:38:03,670 --> 00:38:05,150
She doesn't know who Zhiliang is?

820
00:38:05,150 --> 00:38:06,840
-She does.
-I do.

821
00:38:06,840 --> 00:38:08,240
I'm Zhiliang's solo fan.

822
00:38:08,440 --> 00:38:09,110
Also,

823
00:38:09,480 --> 00:38:11,320
if you don't welcome our crew,

824
00:38:11,320 --> 00:38:12,320
just say it.

825
00:38:12,510 --> 00:38:14,440
We're here to help your village develop.

826
00:38:14,440 --> 00:38:15,880
-Of course.
-We came here to film.

827
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:17,760
-Yes.
-But you're not only refusing to cooperate,

828
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:19,800
you're also causing all sorts of trouble.

829
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:20,760
The artist's contract

830
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:22,190
is with our crew.

831
00:38:22,190 --> 00:38:23,880
Now that things have come to this,

832
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:24,880
how am I supposed to compensate him?

833
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:26,030
How am I supposed to take responsibility?

834
00:38:26,030 --> 00:38:27,030
How am I supposed to explain this?

835
00:38:27,030 --> 00:38:28,000
Sorry. Sorry.

836
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,360
We really didn't mean it.

837
00:38:29,360 --> 00:38:30,400
I know you didn't mean it.

838
00:38:30,400 --> 00:38:31,630
It's fine, Sister.

839
00:38:31,630 --> 00:38:33,630
It's a minor injury
that just needs a little treatment.

840
00:38:33,630 --> 00:38:35,070
Besides, Zhen meant well.

841
00:38:35,070 --> 00:38:36,480
She was afraid the light stand

842
00:38:36,480 --> 00:38:37,710
would hit those girls,

843
00:38:37,710 --> 00:38:39,590
so she kicked it toward me.

844
00:38:39,590 --> 00:38:40,480
It's really fine.

845
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:42,600
It was just a coincidence.

846
00:38:43,030 --> 00:38:43,950
All in all,

847
00:38:43,970 --> 00:38:45,630
you could say I was just
saving damsels in distress.

848
00:38:45,630 --> 00:38:47,320
-Thank you for your understanding.
-And as you know,

849
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:49,550
I'm in good shape,

850
00:38:49,570 --> 00:38:50,820
naturally strong,

851
00:38:51,030 --> 00:38:52,160
friendly to others,

852
00:38:52,510 --> 00:38:53,780
and most importantly, single.

853
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:54,800
Stop bragging.

854
00:38:54,800 --> 00:38:56,130
Come here and let me see.

855
00:38:57,710 --> 00:38:58,150
Look.

856
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,760
The light stand...

857
00:39:00,760 --> 00:39:01,900
really didn't hurt you?

858
00:39:01,900 --> 00:39:03,090
Didn't I just say

859
00:39:03,120 --> 00:39:04,000
I'm single?

860
00:39:05,590 --> 00:39:06,960
I'm sorry, Mr. Heiliang.

861
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:08,070
I didn't mean it.

862
00:39:08,500 --> 00:39:09,390
It's fine.

863
00:39:10,920 --> 00:39:12,120
I like your kindness.

864
00:39:12,760 --> 00:39:15,280
You don't even remember her name
and you like her?

865
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:17,960
Didn't my injury trend last time?

866
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:19,420
Let's forget it this time.

867
00:39:19,920 --> 00:39:20,880
Alright.

868
00:39:20,880 --> 00:39:22,190
It's great that you're not pursuing this.

869
00:39:22,190 --> 00:39:23,150
Thank you.

870
00:39:23,670 --> 00:39:25,000
But I hope from now on,

871
00:39:25,440 --> 00:39:27,480
you won't appear on set, okay?

872
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:29,400
You're clumsy.

873
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:31,280
I can't cover for you
if you do something else.

874
00:39:31,280 --> 00:39:32,380
And I can't take responsibility.

875
00:39:32,380 --> 00:39:33,840
Let's be considerate of each other.

876
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:34,570
Let's leave it at that.

877
00:39:34,570 --> 00:39:36,030
Let's continue filming. Thanks.

878
00:39:36,030 --> 00:39:36,360
Sister,

879
00:39:36,360 --> 00:39:37,670
I...

880
00:39:37,670 --> 00:39:38,440
Watch out.

881
00:39:38,440 --> 00:39:39,590
I'll go and...

882
00:39:39,590 --> 00:39:42,110
Sister.

883
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:43,960
Don't ban Zhen from the set.

884
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:46,360
Did you forget what you promised me
last night?

885
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,110
Sir, do you need me to

886
00:39:47,110 --> 00:39:48,550
find you a band-aid or something?

887
00:39:48,550 --> 00:39:50,360
No need. I said I'm strong.

888
00:39:50,360 --> 00:39:51,710
I really didn't mean it.

889
00:39:51,710 --> 00:39:52,880
It's okay.

890
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:53,590
I'm an...

891
00:39:53,710 --> 00:39:54,710
ENFP.

892
00:39:54,710 --> 00:39:55,590
What P?

893
00:39:56,190 --> 00:39:57,020
Well, it's a...

894
00:39:57,020 --> 00:39:59,020
personality test. Have you done it?

895
00:39:59,280 --> 00:40:00,000
It's okay.

896
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,960
She's really not like this usually.

897
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,280
Then what's wrong with her today?

898
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:05,140
Did she get triggered seeing you?

899
00:40:05,360 --> 00:40:06,550
You see, as soon as she came to the set,

900
00:40:06,550 --> 00:40:07,840
she caused us so much trouble.

901
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:08,800
I'm sorry, Sister.

902
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:10,280
There are indeed very few women like you,

903
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:11,880
both beautiful and capable.

904
00:40:15,030 --> 00:40:17,160
Don't always tell the truth to my face.

905
00:40:17,320 --> 00:40:18,780
I'm really sorry, Sister.

906
00:40:18,960 --> 00:40:20,400
When I look at your beautiful eyes,

907
00:40:20,400 --> 00:40:21,440
I just can't lie.

908
00:40:22,440 --> 00:40:23,630
Then keep it up.

909
00:40:24,110 --> 00:40:24,670
Sister.

910
00:40:24,840 --> 00:40:26,440
So, about tomorrow night...

911
00:40:26,920 --> 00:40:28,230
I've arranged everything.

912
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:29,830
Will the artists cooperate?

913
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:31,480
A few have already agreed,

914
00:40:31,480 --> 00:40:33,670
but I still need to contact the rest.

915
00:40:34,110 --> 00:40:35,190
Thank you, Sister.

916
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:37,000
I've been busy with your stuff all day

917
00:40:37,000 --> 00:40:38,400
and haven't done any real work.

918
00:40:38,400 --> 00:40:40,000
Wh-What am I even doing here?

919
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:45,030
Hi.

920
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:45,960
Hi.

921
00:40:47,710 --> 00:40:48,670
Why are you here?

922
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:50,860
You're not here for revenge, are you?

923
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:52,670
I really didn't mean it back then.

924
00:40:52,670 --> 00:40:53,550
It's fine. It's fine.

925
00:40:53,550 --> 00:40:54,710
I'm sorry.

926
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,080
It's already healed.

927
00:40:56,230 --> 00:40:57,630
It's just a small injury.

928
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:00,510
Are you okay?

929
00:41:00,510 --> 00:41:01,710
No, I'm just kidding.

930
00:41:02,070 --> 00:41:03,870
I just like to make little jokes.

931
00:41:06,320 --> 00:41:07,180
Not funny, huh?

932
00:41:08,480 --> 00:41:09,080
It's okay.

933
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:10,110
As long as you're okay.

934
00:41:10,110 --> 00:41:11,000
As long as you're okay.

935
00:41:11,000 --> 00:41:11,530
I'm fine.

936
00:41:12,070 --> 00:41:13,930
Being fragile is just my persona.

937
00:41:17,190 --> 00:41:19,670
Well, did your filming go well?

938
00:41:21,020 --> 00:41:23,880
The girls went crazy
when they saw me playing games.

939
00:41:23,990 --> 00:41:25,630
So did it go well or not?

940
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,230
It went well.

941
00:41:29,030 --> 00:41:31,880
So it went well because I wasn't there.

942
00:41:32,590 --> 00:41:33,110
No.

943
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:36,130
If you were there,
it would have gone even better.

944
00:41:37,070 --> 00:41:38,630
We have a concert tomorrow night.

945
00:41:38,630 --> 00:41:39,830
Come if you have time.

946
00:41:40,550 --> 00:41:41,190
I can't.

947
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:43,000
Your crew has already banned me.

948
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:43,630
I can't go.

949
00:41:43,630 --> 00:41:44,550
It's fine.

950
00:41:44,920 --> 00:41:46,550
I'll talk to the director later.

951
00:41:46,550 --> 00:41:47,320
Don't worry.

952
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:49,560
I have a huge fan base.

953
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:52,140
The director can't do anything about me.

954
00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:55,170
Aren't you afraid
you'll be unlucky again if I go?

955
00:41:56,630 --> 00:41:57,630
Just come.

956
00:41:58,670 --> 00:41:59,930
I'm not afraid of that.

957
00:42:01,840 --> 00:42:03,630
It's fine. See you tomorrow.

958
00:42:04,440 --> 00:42:05,640
Be there or be square!

959
00:42:24,360 --> 00:42:25,510
I have a dream.

960
00:42:24,480 --> 00:42:31,770
[Election Speech Conference]

961
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:28,550
I hope all the township banks

962
00:42:28,570 --> 00:42:31,700
will be filled with our villagers' money!

963
00:42:32,280 --> 00:42:33,440
I have a dream.

964
00:42:34,280 --> 00:42:36,430
I hope that here in Shapu,

965
00:42:37,000 --> 00:42:39,230
all elderly people living alone
and children left behind

966
00:42:39,230 --> 00:42:41,230
can receive the best possible care!

967
00:42:42,290 --> 00:42:43,600
I have a dream.

968
00:42:44,960 --> 00:42:46,320
I hope the name Shapu

969
00:42:46,590 --> 00:42:49,050
will ring loud and clear
in the mayor's ears!

970
00:42:49,280 --> 00:42:50,550
I want to make this land

971
00:42:52,480 --> 00:42:53,760
prosperous again!

972
00:42:56,410 --> 00:42:58,760
By then, a household registration in Shapu

973
00:42:58,760 --> 00:43:00,320
will be hard to come by.

974
00:43:17,510 --> 00:43:18,440
Uncle Sangbiao?

975
00:43:19,880 --> 00:43:20,810
Uncle Sangbiao?

976
00:43:23,670 --> 00:43:24,320
Zhen.

977
00:43:24,920 --> 00:43:25,800
I'm Jiahao.

978
00:43:26,280 --> 00:43:27,540
You'll vote for me, right?

979
00:43:27,540 --> 00:43:28,140
Zhen.

980
00:43:28,800 --> 00:43:30,590
I'll vote for Zhen.

981
00:43:30,940 --> 00:43:32,260
Vote for Jiahao.

982
00:43:32,920 --> 00:43:33,590
Zhen.

983
00:43:34,000 --> 00:43:34,590
Jiahao.

984
00:43:34,590 --> 00:43:35,030
Zhen.

985
00:43:35,030 --> 00:43:36,670
I'll definitely vote for you, Zhen.

986
00:43:36,670 --> 00:43:38,530
-It's Jiahao.
-I'll vote for you.

987
00:43:38,670 --> 00:43:40,550
It's Jiahao.

988
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:42,880
Zhen.

989
00:43:51,030 --> 00:43:51,630
Huan.

990
00:43:52,320 --> 00:43:53,780
You'll vote for me, right?

991
00:43:55,710 --> 00:43:57,320
If you don't vote for me,

992
00:43:58,260 --> 00:44:01,860
I'll crush your face
along with your lollipop!

993
00:44:03,800 --> 00:44:05,800
Tell your parents to vote for me too!

994
00:44:06,460 --> 00:44:08,580
One, two, three, four.

995
00:44:08,800 --> 00:44:09,460
Four votes.

996
00:44:11,070 --> 00:44:13,190
Wow, why is it so lively here?

997
00:44:15,630 --> 00:44:16,560
Why are you here?

998
00:44:16,840 --> 00:44:17,920
I was busy with something here yesterday,

999
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:18,780
so I slept here.

1000
00:44:19,320 --> 00:44:20,510
Did my passionate speech just now

1001
00:44:20,510 --> 00:44:21,800
disturb you?

1002
00:44:21,800 --> 00:44:22,480
It's fine.

1003
00:44:23,440 --> 00:44:25,030
But Jiahao, I have to tell you,

1004
00:44:25,030 --> 00:44:26,280
you can't just talk big

1005
00:44:26,280 --> 00:44:27,670
in this election.

1006
00:44:28,400 --> 00:44:30,440
You have to seek actual benefits
for the villagers,

1007
00:44:30,440 --> 00:44:31,360
finding projects for them

1008
00:44:31,360 --> 00:44:32,810
and helping them make money.

1009
00:44:32,810 --> 00:44:34,400
Only then will they respect you.

1010
00:44:34,400 --> 00:44:36,510
Y-Yes.

1011
00:44:36,630 --> 00:44:37,590
The reason I want to be the chief

1012
00:44:37,590 --> 00:44:39,590
is to help the villagers make money.

1013
00:44:40,400 --> 00:44:41,880
Then... what should I do?

1014
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:44,570
I haven't figured that out yet.

1015
00:44:44,570 --> 00:44:45,500
But don't worry.

1016
00:44:45,550 --> 00:44:46,510
Leave it to me.

1017
00:44:46,790 --> 00:44:47,390
Okay.

1018
00:44:48,070 --> 00:44:48,710
Thanks.

1019
00:44:50,450 --> 00:44:51,340
Well...

1020
00:44:51,440 --> 00:44:53,400
It's a good thing
you're not participating in this election,

1021
00:44:53,400 --> 00:44:54,330
otherwise, I...

1022
00:44:55,110 --> 00:44:56,640
What are you talking about?

1023
00:44:57,180 --> 00:44:59,070
Isn't it the same
whichever of us gets elected?

1024
00:44:59,070 --> 00:45:00,110
Yours is mine.

1025
00:45:01,760 --> 00:45:02,760
And mine is yours.

1026
00:45:03,070 --> 00:45:03,470
Right.

1027
00:45:04,360 --> 00:45:04,760
Alright.

1028
00:45:04,760 --> 00:45:06,000
I hope your dream comes true.

1029
00:45:06,000 --> 00:45:06,510
Okay.

1030
00:45:06,800 --> 00:45:08,440
Come to the beach
to watch the show tonight.

1031
00:45:08,440 --> 00:45:09,320
Okay, okay.

1032
00:45:12,670 --> 00:45:13,800
I have a dream.

1033
00:45:14,710 --> 00:45:15,920
I have a...

1034
00:45:16,730 --> 00:45:18,600
dream!
